Package: lcem
Title: Latent Class Models via EM
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Edoardo", "Redivo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "edoardo.redivo@unibo.it")
Description: Fits latent class models for categorical variables with any
    number of levels using expectation-maximisation on distinct response
    patterns. Independent Dirichlet priors give maximum a posteriori
    estimates, with maximum likelihood as the uniform-prior default.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
